   "title": "Reading the spins from the decays",
   "text": [
    "Charged leptons are near-perfect spin analysers ($\\kappa_\\ell\\simeq1$). Fitting the double angular distribution measures $B^\\pm$ and the correlation matrix $C_{ij}$ (the ‘decay method’). The paper compares it with a ‘kinematic method’."
