   "title": "A hierarchy of quantum correlations",
   "text": [
    "EPR steering: measurements on one top ‘steer’ the state of the other in a way no local-hidden-state model reproduces. Every steerable state is entangled, and every Bell-nonlocal state is steerable. Werner states show the three thresholds:"
   ],
